The proposed architecture would involve designing a highly available, scalable, and secure solution using our expertise in cloud architecture, API integration, and AI/ML systems. We would leverage our experience with containerisation, monitoring, and quantisation to optimize the performance of our models and ensure response times below 2 seconds. Additionally, we would ensure seamless integration with existing information systems and user directories using APIs and identity providers, while hosting the solution on sovereign infrastructure within the EU to meet the client's requirements.
